# Runs as the unprivileged sbx user. StrictModes is off because the key file lives under sticky /tmp, which the strict parent-directory check rejects.
Port 2222
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
Protocol 2
PidFile /tmp/sshd/sshd.pid
HostKey /tmp/sshd/ssh_host_ed25519_key
AuthorizedKeysFile /tmp/sshd/authorized_keys
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitRootLogin no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
UsePAM no
AllowUsers sbx
AllowTcpForwarding no
AllowAgentForwarding no
X11Forwarding no
PermitTunnel no
GatewayPorts no
PermitUserEnvironment no
StrictModes no
LogLevel INFO
PrintMotd no
PermitUserRC no
AcceptEnv
MaxAuthTries 3
LoginGraceTime 20
